    "body": "Requested: PDFs should open in a separate DEVONthink window instead of the small viewer beneath the database view, and several PDFs must be possible at once.\n\n- `openInDatabases` now calls DEVONthink's `open window for record` and `activate`, instead of `open location` with the `x-devonthink-item://` link (which replaced the previous PDF in the main window's viewer).\n- Several PDFs: a Finder selection sent in one event is handled one after the other, each getting a window.\n- `DT_OPEN_MODE` (window/reveal) is removed from the code, the config and the docs.\n- Handlers renamed: `openInDEVONthink`, `findAndOpen`, `openInDatabases` (true/false instead of a link).\n- Not run on a Mac. Not checked: what DEVONthink does when a window for that record is already open.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBSPryU16ZirHGRiaX)_",
