                    "email": "noreply@anthropic.com",
                    "name": "Claude"
                },
                "message": "✨ feat: open PDFs from DEVONthink in a window of their own\n\nThe applet opened the record's x-devonthink-item:// link, which showed the\nPDF in the viewer under the database list of the main window, where the next\nPDF replaced it. It now uses DEVONthink's \"open window for record\" (then\nactivate), so every PDF gets its own window and several can be open at once,\nalso when the Finder sends them in one event. The DT_OPEN_MODE setting\n(window/reveal) is removed: there is only the window. The handlers are\nrenamed to say what they do (openInDEVONthink, findAndOpen, openInDatabases)\nand return true/false instead of a link. Not run on a Mac.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBSPryU16ZirHGRiaX",
                "tree": {
                    "sha": "6195125824b603de288f396bd5671238962c88fd",
                    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/siainbuletin/dotfiles/git/trees/6195125824b603de288f396bd5671238962c88fd"
                },
                "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/siainbuletin/dotfiles/git/commits/20930d866153cda55af191c75baee832f570c3ce",
                "verification": {
                    "payload": "tree 6195125824b603de288f396bd5671238962c88fd\nparent f8e8feddda9f6b4ef7f95635d0243ccf416bb2de\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1794482623 +0200\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1794482623 +0200\n\n✨ feat: open PDFs from DEVONthink in a window of their own\n\nThe applet opened the record's x-devonthink-item:// link, which showed the\nPDF in the viewer under the database list of the main window, where the next\nPDF replaced it. It now uses DEVONthink's \"open window for record\" (then\nactivate), so every PDF gets its own window and several can be open at once,\nalso when the Finder sends them in one event. The DT_OPEN_MODE setting\n(window/reveal) is removed: there is only the window. The handlers are\nrenamed to say what they do (openInDEVONthink, findAndOpen, openInDatabases)\nand return true/false instead of a link. Not run on a Mac.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBSPryU16ZirHGRiaX\n",
